# Relay password: ASCII letters, digits and symbols only. Enter the same value in each
# source's relay settings in Aidoku. The relay refuses to start until you change it.
# 轉發密碼，只能用英文字母、數字與符號。Aidoku 裡每個圖源的轉發設定都填同一組。沒換掉範例值就不會啟動。
RELAY_TOKEN=change-me-to-a-long-password

# Optional. Hosts the relay may forward to, comma separated; `*` matches anything, so
# `*.example.com` covers its subdomains. Every public host is allowed when left out.
# Hosts on your local network are always refused.
# 選填。允許轉發的網域，以逗號分隔，`*` 代表任意字元，`*.example.com` 涵蓋它的子網域。
# 不填就允許所有公開網域。家裡區網的位址一律拒絕。
# ALLOWED_HOSTS=bakamh.com,bakamh.ru,baka1.cfd,baka2.cfd,baka3.cfd,18mh.org
